                    <seg rendition="#center">[Sub-Annex]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>[This document consists of detailed descriptions of the sections of the
                    Franco-Italian frontier which correspond to the modifications provided for under
                    Article 2, and of the Dodecanese boundary in view of the provisions of Article
                    12; for text, see Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Paris Peace
                        Conference, 1946</hi>, Selected Documents, <ref target="#pg580">page
                        580</ref>.]</p>
